{"id":"f4f9856f6b0cb033","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure.md","title":"ZFC Largecard4 Fine Measure","display":"df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure — ZFC Largecard4 Fine Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure — ZFC Largecard4 Fine Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard4-fine-measure — ZFC Largecard4 Fine Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (fine ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4FineMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4FineMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}fine\\text{-}measure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4FineMeasure}_S(X,\\kappa,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\exists P_\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(P_\\kappa=\\{a\\subseteq X:|a|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,P_\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,P_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\{a\\in P_\\kappa:x\\in a\\}\\in U)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}fine\\text{-}measure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4FineMeasure}_S(X,\\kappa,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\exists P_\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(P_\\kappa=\\{a\\subseteq X:|a|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,P_\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(U,P_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\{a\\in P_\\kappa:x\\in a\\}\\in U)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In the large-cardinal sense, a fine measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\\)</span> is represented by a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete fine ultrafilter. Fineness alone would define only a fine ultrafilter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"56914510091eed27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (cardinal, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"56914510091eed27","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S$ ($\\kappa$-complete-filter predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":